# Monza2 (QCS8300) — true-minimum hand list for an eMMC root on kernel 6.8.0-1078-qcom.
#
# Because the root-mount path is fully BUILTIN (ext4/mmc_block/sdhci_msm/dm = y), the
# initramfs needs almost nothing to reach the rootfs. These are the only board-specific
# modules worth loading early; everything else in the full MODULES=dep set (see
# modules.list) is generic boilerplate for LVM/RAID/crypt/iSCSI roots that this board does
# not use. Use with MODULES=list in /etc/initramfs-tools/initramfs.conf.
#
# Caveat: this is the aggressive hand-minimum. MODULES=dep (modules.list) is the supported,
# safer choice and is already small (27 MB). Validate any hand list with a one-shot GRUB
# test entry (see 42_slimtest) before making it the default.

# Qualcomm SoC platform (remoteproc firmware load + IPC + llcc + pinctrl + rtc)
llcc-qcom
mdt_loader
qcom_common
qcom_glink_smem
qcom_pil_info
qcom_q6v5
qcom_q6v5_pas
qcom_sysmon
pinctrl-lpass-lpi
pinctrl-qcs8300-lpass-lpi
rtc-pm8xxx

# PHY
phy-qcom-edp
phy-qcom-sgmii-eth
